## Scientific boundary

`SOL_PRO_PASS_DOCUMENTARY_AND_INVENTORY_FIT_BENCH_READY` means the reconstruction closes arithmetically, is executable from the recorded stocks, preserves target recognizers as a formulation hypothesis, controls high-impact traces and has a plausible model-only temporal profile.

It does not mean a proprietary commercial formula was recovered. Strict OAV requires compatible measured concentration and odor-threshold data. Measured headspace requires physical sampling. Final olfactory equivalence requires matured pilots and coded comparison against an authenticated reference. Skin-use clearance requires current supplier-specific safety calculations.
